          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi nami, nkosi u-Aritahishashita, ngiyaleza bonke abaphathi-zimali abangaphesheya komfula ukuthi konke u-Ezra umpristi, isazi somthetho kaNkulunkulu wezulu, ayakukubuza kini, makwenziwe masinyane;",
