              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuze kube ngamathalenta esiliva ayikhulu, amakhora kakolweni ayikhulu, nezindebe zewayini ezifika eziyikhulu, nezimbiza zamafutha nosawoti eziyikhulu ngaphandle kokusho ukuthi yimalini.",
