              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noma ngubani ongawenzi umthetho kaNkulunkulu wakho nomthetho wenkosi, makugwetshwe masinyane kuye, noma elokufa, noma elokuxoshwa, noma elokudliwa kwempahla, noma elokuboshwa.",
